      'the triple point is meteorologically important because it is a favoured spot for NEW low pressure development a secondary or wave cyclone and for enhanced lift and severe thunderstorms so occluded front equals the wrap around frontal line triple point equals the junction where cold warm and occluded fronts all come together',
